{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0FybWFhbiUyMCUyODIwMDMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Armaan","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/iUWnIdPCPA38i8eq9hpEBDTAeBM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r8L44sbcIzJHbFb9Wa4dNsxqlO4.jpg","description":"Dr. Siddharth Sinha is a dedicated selfless doctor who dreams of building a state-of-the-art hospital with all the modern instruments and amenities for patient care . His foster son Akash shares his dream . Akash falls in love with Neha Mathur , an anaesthetist in the same hospital . In a friend's party , Akash meets Sonia who is a spoilt daughter of a millionaire Gulshan Kapoor . Sonia develops an infatuation for Akash . Gulshan Kapoor proposes to Dr. Siddharth Sinha that he will donate a big sum of money to his hospital , on the condition that Akash marries Sonia . Dr. Siddharth Sinha declines but dies of a heart attack a few days later . Burdened with fulfilling his father's dream , Akash decides to marry Sonia sacrificing his own love . But even after marriage Sonia is jealous of Neha and constantly accuses Akash of infidelity which leaves him in a dilemma , torn between two women .\n\nReleased 16 May 2003 · India · Language: Hindi · 158 min\nStudio: Dhudiya Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2003","genres":["Drama","Romance","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.3","runtime":"158 min","cast":["Amitabh Bachchan","Anil Kapoor","Preity Zinta","Gracy Singh","Aamir Bashir","Randhir Kapoor","Mangala Kenkre","Suhita Thatte"],"director":["Honey Irani"],"released":"2003-05-16T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Love... Ambition... Desire...","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Honey Irani","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6NzWdPSbuibsoIJs7mcPWtYGmmJ.jpg"},{"name":"Amitabh Bachchan","character":"Dr. Siddharth Sinha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u69PvpWqGkywSm0YjFiw77j9eqS.jpg"},{"name":"Anil Kapoor","charact